    "title": "Theft of show cats leads to arrest of Mishawaka couple - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Reporter ,\n6 hours ago ELKHART COUNTY, Ind. (WSBT) — There are alarming allegations against a Mishawaka couple in jail Wednesday night, accused of committing a crime involving cats. 62-year-old Michael Minix and his wife, 58-year-old Cathy Minix, were booked into the Elkhart County Jail on Saturday for seven different charges, including robbery, theft, and assault. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
